<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>tsbg bd cancel3</Major>
    <Description>The Strongest Battlegrounds. Backdash cancel for third skill. Best Character to use - the strongest hero.
Usage: after doing a hook dash u hold S and press button u binded the macro and u will be able to combo extend/end based on skill u use ( mostly used on the strongest hero bcz of low chance of getting punished cuz shove endlag is small)</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 32 1
Delay 1 ms
KeyUp 32 1
Delay 5 ms
KeyDown 20 1
Delay 1 ms
KeyUp 20 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Roblox</Software>
